      <p>The Case Trail is a five-case murder sudoku story. A Cat Burglar has struck five times, and every crime scene is a logic puzzle in its own right. Each case uses the classic murder sudoku rules: place every suspect on the grid so that no two figures share a row or a column, follow the witness statements, and the suspect left alone in the victim's room is the killer.</p>
